  "review": {
    "note": "Reviewed fresh public PyPI/npm candidates for every direct build, runtime, development and Node dependency, including versions beyond current upper bounds. Compared with the committed 0.25.6 audit, hatchling advanced from 1.32.3 to 1.32.4 and markdownlint-cli2 from 0.23.2 to 0.23.3; all other registry candidates are unchanged, so identical-version upstream reviews carry forward. Reviewed https://hatch.pypa.io/dev/history/hatchling/ for the BuildHookInterface compatibility/CalVer fixes and upstream markdownlint-cli2 package CHANGELOG for 0.23.3 dependency updates. Installed latest direct versions in an independent worktree venv; uv pip check passed for 43 packages and npm reports no vulnerabilities. Requires coordinated local Core 0.40.0 for exact unpublished sealed-observation reuse and targeted refresh hints; public registry latest 0.39.11 does not satisfy this lower bound and is not claimed to do so. Built and installed the explicitly supplied h2hdb-0.40.0 wheel; clean checkout rebuild supports an explicit wheel override without sibling discovery. Ingest 0.26.0 removes whole-turn source-byte retention and defaults to full completed-source selection; immutable database schema and artifact formats are unchanged. Manual runtime experiments, live-MariaDB tests and exact-tree gate have separate evidence and are not implied by this receipt.",
    "status": "reviewed"
  },
  "schema": "h2h.dependency-audit.v1"
